Here’s my solution:

```python
def find_length_of_shortest_subarray_to_remove(arr):
    left = 0
    right = len(arr) - 1
    while left < right and arr[left] <= arr[left + 1]:
        left += 1
    if left == len(arr) - 1:
        return 0
    while arr[right - 1] <= arr[right]:
        right -= 1
    max_length = right - left - 1
    for i in range(left + 1, right):
        while left >= 0 and arr[left] > arr[i]:
            left -= 1
        while right < len(arr) and arr[right] < arr[i]:
            right += 1
        max_length = min(max_length, right - left - 1)
    return max_length
```
</reasoning>

