<solution>
```python
def maxProfit(prices):
    if not prices:
        return 0
    n = len(prices)
    hold = [0] * n
    sold = [0] * n
    rest = [0] * n
    hold[0] = -prices[0]
    for i in range(1, n):
        hold[i] = max(hold[i-1], rest[i-1] - prices[i])
        sold[i] = hold[i-1] + prices[i]
        rest[i] = max(rest[i-1], sold[i-1])
    return max(rest[-1], sold[-1])
```
</solution>

