-----Solution-----
```python
def nim_sum(sequence):
    return reduce(lambda x, y: x ^ y, sequence)

def first_player_wins(sequence):
    if nim_sum(sequence) == 0:
        return False
    return True

def game_winner(sequence):
    if first_player_wins(sequence):
        return "YES"
    return "NO"
```
