                best_rating = ratings[i]
                best_index = i
            elif lengths[i] == best_length:
                if ratings[i] > best_rating:
                    best_rating = ratings[i]
                    best_index = i
    return best_index
```

This solution has a time complexity of O(n), where n is the number of movies. It's also quite readable and easy to understand, which is a big plus in my book.

