<code>
```python
def minHeightShelves(books, shelf_width):
    n = len(books)
    dp = [0] * (n + 1)
    for i in range(1, n + 1):
        max_height = books[i - 1][1]
        total_width = books[i - 1][0]
        dp[i] = dp[i - 1] + max_height
        for j in range(i - 1, 0, -1):
            if total_width + books[j - 1][0] > shelf_width:
                break
            max_height = max(max_height, books[j - 1][1])
            total_width += books[j - 1][0]
            dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[j - 1] + max_height)
    return dp[n]
```
</code>

