<solution>
```python
def maxNumberOfFamilies(n, reservedSeats):
    row_count = n
    for row, seat in reservedSeats:
        if seat in [2, 3, 4, 5] or seat in [6, 7, 8, 9]:
            row_count -= 1
            if seat in [4, 5, 6, 7] or seat in [8, 9, 10, 11]:
                row_count += 1
    return row_count * 2
```
</solution>

