Here’s my solution:

<solution>
```python
def totalLicks(env):
    ickies = 252
    ickie_diffs = {
        "freezing temps": -10,
        "clear skies": +2,
        # Add more environmental conditions here
    }
    toughest_condition = None
    toughest_licks = 0
    for env_key, ickie_diff in ickie_diffs.items():
        ickies += ickie_diff
        if abs(ickie_diff) > toughest_licks:
            toughest_licks = abs(ickie_diff)
            toughest_condition = env_key
    return f"It took {ickies} licks to get to the tootsie roll center of a tootsie pop. The toughest challenge was {toughest_condition}."
```
</solution>

