We can use a list to keep track of which lockers are open. Initially, all lockers are closed (False), and we toggle them as Johnny runs past them. We can use a simple loop to simulate Johnny’s runs, and an extra loop to keep track of which lockers have been toggled an odd number of times.

<solution>
```python
def open_lockers(n):
    lockers = [False] * n
    for i in range(n):
        for j in range(i, n, i + 1):
            lockers[j] = not lockers[j]
    return [i + 1 for i, is_open in enumerate(lockers) if is_open]
```
</solution>

