<code>
```python
def scratch_lottery(lottery):
    # Initialize streak counters
    best_streak = 0
    current_streak = 0

    # Loop through each set of characters
    for i in range(len(lottery)):
        # Get the current set of characters
        current_chars = lottery[i]

        # Loop through each character in the set
        for j in range(len(current_chars)):
            # Check if it's the same as the next one
            if j+1 < len(current_chars) and current_chars[j] == current_chars[j+1]:
                # Increment the streak
                current_streak += 1
            else:
                # Check if this is the best streak so far
                if current_streak > best_streak:
                    best_streak = current_streak
                # Reset the streak
                current_streak = 0

    # Return the total bonus
    return best_streak * 100
```
</code>

</reasoning>

