```python
def make_pattern(m, n):
    fib = [1, 1]
    for i in range(2, m):
        fib.append(fib[-1] + fib[-2])

    return "\n".join(["".join(["o" if fib[i] % n == 0 else " " for i in range(len(fib))]) for _ in range(n)])
```

