Here’s my solution:

```python
def f(k, n):
    def sum_floor(i):
        return sum(f(k, floor(i / k)) for i in range(1, n + 1))

    def recursive_sum_floor(i):
        if i == 0:
            return 1
        return recursive_sum_floor(i - 1) + sum_floor(i)

    return recursive_sum_floor(n)
```
</reasoning>

