<code>
```python
def shades_of_grey(n):
  if n < 0:
    return []
  elif n > 254:
    return ['#010101'] * 254
  else:
    result = []
    for i in range(n):
      result.append('#{:02x}{:02x}{:02x}'.format((i % 255) + 1, (i % 255) + 1, (i % 255) + 1))
    return result
```
