```python
def countUniqueChars(s):
    unique_chars = set()
    total_unique_chars = 0
    for char in s:
        if char not in unique_chars:
            total_unique_chars += 1
            unique_chars.add(char)
        else:
            unique_chars.remove(char)
    return total_unique_chars
```

